    "created_at": "2015-07-14T22:35:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-07-14T22:35:28Z",
    "body": "Right, I guess I was thinking some kind of use counter for `item()` called on `addedNodes` and `removedNodes` specifically. But, as @sicking says in IRC, maybe a better time investment to just work on a subclass with item() than trying to wack-a-mole item() usages everywhere.\n\nI agree that in the general case we're not going to be able to kill NodeList.\n",
