    "updated_at": "2015-07-14T22:37:20Z",
    "body": "For use counters of that sort you can take inspiration from `DOMStringList` in Blink, where @inexorabletash added some tracking to see in which contexts `DOMStringList` can be killed, because there is still hope that it can be killed entirely.\n",
