    "updated_at": "2015-08-04T11:23:26Z",
    "body": "I'm going to close this. Once we have subclassing in browsers we can go through all the various cases that could maybe be replaced and do it and file clear issues with the new IDL and processing model. Until that time I'm not sure it's worth tracking these individually.\n",
